    old "{color=#6496FF}About game updates,[C_Off] I can say that {bt}{b}someday around{/b}{/bt} the end of each month:{p}* the current public version may be removed;{p}* the current early access version may come out publicly;{p}* the new updated version may come out as the new early access.{p}{p}Did you realize that there are students without data on the student list? That's because there are 'slots' in the classroom, but the characters haven't been created yet. So... Do you have cool ideas for characters you'd like to see in the game someday? Now there's a place for you to give suggestions for future characters on our {a=https://discord.gg/raU65TZqbE}Discord{/a}! Also, feel free to interact; give me feedbacks; report errors; tell which waifu is your favorite one; and of course, chat with other cool pervert people like us!!! UwU"
    new "{color=#6496FF}关于游戏更新，[C_Off]预计在每个月月底{bt}{b}前后的某一天{/b}{/bt}：{p}* 当前公开版可能会下架；{p}* 当前抢先体验版可能转为公开版；{p}* 新版本则作为新的抢先体验版发布。{p}{p}发现学生名单里有些学生没有资料了吗？教室里的位置已经安排好了，但对应的角色还没有创作出来。你有没有特别想在游戏中见到的角色？现在可以到我们的 {a=https://discord.gg/raU65TZqbE}Discord{/a} 提建议啦！也欢迎来交流、反馈、报错、聊聊你最喜欢的老婆，当然，也可以和我们这些同样不正经的家伙一起唠嗑！！！UwU"

