    old "{size=40}{i}“You are [C_Nam][fnamehero] [lnamehero][C_Off], a kind of [C_Per][personality[0]!l] boy[C_Off]. After the death of your father, you found yourself in a difficult situation living alone in [C_Nam][rnamevil1][C_Off], so you decided to accept the invitation from your stepmother [C_Nam][fnamewmom][C_Off], to live again in [C_Nam][rnamecity][C_Off] with her and her daughter.{pr}{pr}In your childhood memories, you remember playing a lot with two girls, your stepsister [C_Nam][fnamewsis][C_Off], who was quite bossy and difficult to deal with most of the time, but still called you [C_Nam][wsis_to_hero][C_Off] in her calm moments; and your neighbor [C_Nam][fnamewnei][C_Off], who was very friendly and extremely energetic. On some weekends, your stepmother used to take you to play at the house of her mother, [C_Nam]Mrs. [fnamewgma][C_Off], who lived with her granddaughter, [C_Nam][fnamewcou][C_Off], the girl who was your first crush.{pr}{pr}Those were good times. However, you kind of... {bt}Have grown a lot{/bt} since then. Maybe things might have changed.”{/i}{/size}"
    new "{size=40}{i}“你叫[C_Nam][fnamehero] [lnamehero][C_Off]，是个性格[C_Per][personality[0]!l][C_Off]的男生。父亲去世后，你独自生活在[C_Nam][rnamevil1][C_Off]，处境日渐艰难。于是，你接受了继母[C_Nam][fnamewmom][C_Off]的邀请，回到[C_Nam][rnamecity][C_Off]，与她和她的女儿同住。{pr}{pr}童年的记忆里，你经常和两个女孩一起玩：继姐妹[C_Nam][fnamewsis][C_Off]，她大多数时候都很霸道、难相处，但心情好时仍会叫你[C_Nam][wsis_to_hero][C_Off]；以及邻家女孩[C_Nam][fnamewnei][C_Off]，她十分友善，仿佛有用不完的精力。有些周末，继母还会带你去她母亲[C_Nam][fnamewgma]女士[C_Off]家玩。她和孙女[C_Nam][fnamewcou][C_Off]住在一起，而那个女孩，正是你最初暗恋的人。{pr}{pr}那真是一段美好的时光。不过，自那以后，你也……{bt}长大了不少{/bt}。或许，一切都已经变了。”{/i}{/size}"

